=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the **Darkened Crevice** at (G-8) in {z:Woh Gates} to enter "**The Gates**" BCNM against waves of {p:Umbrils|Umbril}.
** You may attempt the Battlefield solo.
** The battle starts automatically after about a minute. Giving you a quick moment to buff and call {p:Trusts|Trust}.
* You are assisted by {p:Arciela}, {p:Darrcuiln|Darrcuiln (NPC)}, **Noble Warrior**, and some cute **Resolute Leafkins**.
** **Arciela** Casts {p:Haste}, {s:Protect V}, and {s:Shell V} on herself, party members, and the other NPCs.
* The fight is lost if any NPCs die.
** The NPCs can be buffed and healed with {p:Blood Pact: Wards|Blood Pact: Ward}.
** NPCs can also be buffed via accession if you cast it on a trust you summon, such as {s:Regen V}.
** Curaga when cast on a Trust will affect the entire group, but not when cast on a PC.
* The fight is still won if all players are dead, but the NPCs finish killing the monsters.
* See the {p:Discussion Page|Talk:Seekers of Adoulin Mission 4-3} page for strategies and further battle information.

=2 Notes
* If you fail this BCNM, you can reaquire the {@k} {k:Tuft of golden fur} in {z:Woh Gates} by examining the **Large Animal Track** mark at the border of (J-8)/(K-8) near the {z:Yorcia Weald} exit.
** All players currently on the Mission require the Key Item to enter. Players who have previously completed it do not. Entry will be denied if there are any party members who lack the Key Item or previous completion.

